oing  to eventually find their way either into  the proletariat or or doing something  else and the professional classes are  always just one step away from becoming  the proletariat the word proletariat is  a latin word  originally and it meant those who could  only contribute one kind of thing prolly  sure they had no property they had  nothing going for them except for their  capacity to reproduce now in modern  industrial society the proletariat have  one thing going for them their ability  to work their ability to supply labor so  they are the labor force in modern  industrial society
 

